    "en": {
      "name": "Transam Scride",
      "effect": "Send the top card of your Deck to the Graveyard. If a LIGHT Attribute Galaxy Type monster is sent to the Graveyard by this effect, you can choose up to 3 face-up monsters on your field. This turn, the chosen monsters inflict piercing battle damage. If you chose a \"Transam Linac\", you can change all Attack Position monster on your opponent's field to face-up Defense Position."
